index 4479b53..28893ab 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -15,3 +15,14 @@ The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## On-device translation
+
+Articles and teasers have a translate control powered by the browser's built-in
+[Translator](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/translator-api) and
+[Language Detector](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/language-detection) APIs,
+so all translation happens locally, on the reader's device. Mark a container with
+`data-translate-scope` and the elements whose text should be translated with
+`data-translatable`, then drop `<TranslateControl client:visible />` inside the scope.
+In browsers without these APIs, the control is hidden in teasers and shows a short
+note on the article page.
